Local change made here: config.json sets
  "decoder_start_token": "<s>"   (upstream shipped "</s>")
  "add_source_eos": true         (upstream shipped false)
Without both, CTranslate2 output degenerates into repetition loops. The
vocabulary has no "<pad>" token, so the usual OPUS-MT "<pad>" setting cannot be
used for this model.

